      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 leading-tight">
        BC PNP 2026 Draws Recap: Every Skills Immigration Draw and What It Signals for 2027
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-4">
        2026 was the year the BC PNP stopped running one big points contest and started running several smaller, targeted ones. Here is every published draw, the trends inside them, and what those trends do and do not tell you about 2027.
      </p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-500">
        <time datetime="2026-10-14">October 14, 2026</time>
